WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.600
A notebook, a spreadsheet, memories — and sometimes

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.200
doubt. Tchoua turns traditional solidarity into a

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:10.800
complete, transparent digital platform that everyone

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:14.400
can access.

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:18.756
In a few minutes, define your activities, rules, board

00:00:18.756 --> 00:00:23.111
and members. Every association keeps its own identity,

00:00:23.111 --> 00:00:27.467
bylaws and way of working.

00:00:27.467 --> 00:00:31.433
Cash, in-kind or services: every contribution is

00:00:31.433 --> 00:00:35.400
recorded, calculated and tracked. Mobile Money, bank

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:39.367
or cash desk: every movement stays traceable, from

00:00:39.367 --> 00:00:43.333
first payment to last.

00:00:43.333 --> 00:00:46.950
On meeting day, each member makes one payment. The

00:00:46.950 --> 00:00:50.567
allocation engine automatically splits it between

00:00:50.567 --> 00:00:54.183
tontine, savings, solidarity, investment and loan

00:00:54.183 --> 00:00:57.800
repayment.

00:00:57.800 --> 00:01:02.422
Loans, social aid and expenses follow configurable

00:01:02.422 --> 00:01:07.044
rules, approvals and an audit trail. The board stays

00:01:07.044 --> 00:01:11.667
in control; members keep full transparency.

00:01:11.667 --> 00:01:16.667
Each member sees their own transactions. The board

00:01:16.667 --> 00:01:21.667
accesses reports, histories, dividends and exports.

00:01:21.667 --> 00:01:26.667
Decisions become verifiable, session after session.

00:01:26.667 --> 00:01:31.067
The mobile app lets you check balances, sessions and

00:01:31.067 --> 00:01:35.467
activities, even on a limited connection. The

00:01:35.467 --> 00:01:39.867
interface speaks French, English, Spanish and German.

00:01:39.867 --> 00:01:44.222
Tchoua is free, open source and self-hostable. Create

00:01:44.222 --> 00:01:48.578
your association today at tchoua.com and give your

00:01:48.578 --> 00:01:52.933
solidarity the transparency it deserves.
